2. GRANT OF RIGHTS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Subject to Your strict compliance with all terms and restrictions of this
License, Licensor hereby grants You a non-exclusive, worldwide, revocable,
non-transferable, non-sublicensable license to:

2.1 Source Code Inspection
    Download, clone, read, inspect, and audit the source code of the Engine.

2.2 Local Modification
    Modify the Engine source code and create Modifications solely for Your own
    local, private, or internal development use.

2.3 Game Development
    Use the unmodified Engine or Your Modifications to design, develop,
    compile, and build Games, whether intended for free or commercial release.

2.4 Distribution of Free or Commercial Games and Required Runtime Components
    Distribute Your finished Game Build (free of charge or commercially), and
    include within that Game Build the compiled Engine Runtime Components
    (compiled from either the unmodified Engine or Your Modifications) SOLELY
    as an integral part of Your Game Build and strictly to the extent necessary
    to enable end users to execute Your Game.

